Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Add Titan current-job pointer, admission/exit gates, and
 QR18 ladder loop.

Persist one current job next to mission authority (filesystem + Postgres CAS).
Operational commands look back with select() and stamp state_version before tools.
Slice/stop paths write a tie-in checkpoint; boot heal keeps the pointer on the live job.
Advisory envelopes cannot admit tools. Sold deploys fail closed without Postgres.
